  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/02/jyzn.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblog.valhelsia.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Website-Valhelsia.net-F7F3F5?labelColor=030B14&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"193\" height=\"26\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frdfQuaM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/396333981601234944?color=F7F3F5&labelColor=030B14&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&label=Discord&logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"196\" height=\"26\"></span></strong></a></span> <strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/valhelsia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Valhelsia?color=F7F3F5&labelColor=030B14&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&label=Twitter&logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"138\" height=\"26\"></a> </strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fValhelsia%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/reddit/subreddit-subscribers/valhelsia?label=Reddit&color=F7F3F5&labelColor=030B14&style=for-the-badge&logo=Reddit&logoColor=FBAA3E\" width=\"126\" height=\"26\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>加入我们的 Discord 服务器，获取最新新闻、更新日志，并在遇到问题时获得支持。我们还有一个非常活跃的聊天频道，以及由社区成员提交的照片画廊。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fValhelsia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/34/gt6c.png\"></a><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/37/yp3u.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">拥有令人惊叹的全新生物群系，搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Biomes O' Plenty</span></a>、<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></span>、<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></span>、<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/druidcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Druidcraft</a></span>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">大量全新方块，涵盖多种材质与配色方案，助力提升你的建筑作品并美化周边环境。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">探索全新的结构与地牢，均由我们自研的 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valhelsia-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valhelsia Structures</a></span> 模组生成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">得益于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">The Endergetic Expansion</span></a>，末地将迎来大量全新内容等你探索。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">世界地表的改进不仅限于此，得益于 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;YUNG's Better Caves</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Mineshafts</a></span> 的全面改造，以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Quark</span></a> 提供的地下生物群系，地下世界也焕然一新。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">借助 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Mekanism</span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Immersive Engineering</span></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Create</span></a> 打造全自动化工厂。并使用 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/engineers-decor\" rel=\"nofollow\">Engineer's Decor</a></span> 进行合理装饰。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Botania</span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Eidolon</span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Blood Magic</span></a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astral-sorcery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Astral Sorcery</span></a> 等模组学习全新的魔法能力并制作魔法物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无论是通过魔法还是科技，都能为你打造全新的护甲与工具。或者选择使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Tetra</span></a> 制作工具与武器，融合多种材料以打造完全自定义且模块化的装备。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">探索将获得独特 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts</a></span> 作为奖励，它们可在地牢、埋藏的宝藏或末地城中找到。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">体验多款顶级品质的全新模组，例如 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></span> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Supplementaries</span></a>，并通过 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abnormals-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abnormals Delight</a><span style=\"color:#000\"> 实现与其他模组的兼容。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">包含众多提升游戏体验的便利类模组，让游戏交互更加轻松，数量繁多在此不一一列举！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">集成多款优化性能的模组，例如 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ferritecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/performant\" rel=\"nofollow\">Performant</a></span>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们精心挑选了一系列模组，旨在带来绝佳的全新游戏体验；在尽量涵盖各类玩家偏好的同时，我们也尽可能避免了内容重复。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">内置由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress/\" rel=\"nofollow\">tdstress</a> 制作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/updated-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Updated Engineering</span></a> 资源包（已获 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/updated-engineering?comment=18\" rel=\"nofollow\">授权</a>）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/37/79iv.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们将在未来相当长的一段时间内持续开发并支持该整合包，包括添加许多全新（及新移植）的模组。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/37/ciyd.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以下是 Valhelsia 3 世界生成的部分示例图片，使用游戏内的 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsildurs-shaders.github.io%252fdownloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Sildur's Vibrant Shaders (Extreme-Volumetric Lighting)</span></a><span style=\"color:#000\"> 拍摄，该光影依赖安装 OptiFine 模组（整合包未自带，<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.valhelsia.net%252fnavigation%252fknowledgebase%252foptifine\" rel=\"nofollow\">添加方法的说明请见此处</a></span>）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/rktw.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/0g8d.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/wvj8.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/vf3l.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/97pp.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/i7a1.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/rru8.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/uxsj.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/snsw.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/9l2t.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/6qyl.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/i70n.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/c6o0.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/02/c3qu.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/20/29/ydwn.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/20/29/9nzs.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/20/29/zvt1.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/20/29/en67.png\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/07/beku.png\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/37/iv5o.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>最低分配内存：</strong>4 GB</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>推荐分配内存：</strong>通常建议 5-6 GB；若使用 OptiFine、高渲染距离、调高视频设置、HD 资源包和/或光影包，则建议 6-8 GB。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们的 Wiki 上有一份关于 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.valhelsia.net%252fnavigation%252fknowledgebase%252fallocating-memory\" rel=\"nofollow\">分配内存的指南</a></span>。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>OptiFine：</strong>有关 OptiFine 的兼容性与设置信息，请参阅我们的 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.valhelsia.net%252fnavigation%252fknowledgebase%252foptifine\" rel=\"nofollow\">知识库</a></span>。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/21/37/eao3.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>最后更新：3.2.4</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abnormals-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abnormals Core API（由 TeamAbnormals 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abnormals-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abnormals Delight（由 TeamAbnormals 制作） </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/absent-by-design\" rel=\"nofollow\">Absent by Design（由 Lothrazar 制作） </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abundance\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abundance（由 ex0planetary 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ai-improvements\" rel=\"nofollow\">AI Improvements（由 DarkGuardsman 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aiot-botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">AIOT Botania（由 MelanX 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/akashic-tome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Akashic Tome（由 Vazkii 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs（由 alex1the1666 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allurement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allurement（由 TeamAbnormals 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmbientSounds 3（由 CreativeMD 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis（由 Shadows_of_Fire 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin（由 squeek502 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2（由 Shadowclaimer 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-paradox\" rel=\"nofollow\">Archer's Paradox（由 TeamCoFH 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-toughness-bar\" rel=\"nofollow\">Armor Toughness Bar（由 tfarecnim 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts（由 ochotonida 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astral-sorcery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Astral Sorcery（由 HellFirePvP 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric（由 TeamAbnormals 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autoreglib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoRegLib（由 Vazkii 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity（由 TeamAbnormals 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/back-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back Tools（由 ohaiiChun 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bayou-blues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bayou Blues（由 ex0planetary 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bamboo-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bamboo Blocks（由 bageldotjpg 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bed-benefits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bed Benefits（由 DarkhaxDev 制作）</a></li>\n<li>